          "id": "shadow",
          "type": "select",
          "label": "Shadow",
          "default": "none",
          "help": "What the drop shadow applies to: the box outline, the text, the visible content (image alpha), or Depth - a soft shadow derived from the box's own depth, so lifting a box off the surface casts further. Raster and SVG export are faithful. In PDF, box and text shadows stay vector; content and Depth follow the shape of the artwork, so those boxes export as an embedded image.",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "none",
              "label": "None"
            },
            {
              "value": "box",
              "label": "Box"
            },
            {
              "value": "text",
              "label": "Text"
